// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2230389911" "Them Longbow types are startin' to be a problem with dimensional travelin'. They've got some way a' detecting when we move, an' gettin people in place ta interfere. Worse than the Nemesis Army, those lot are. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Well, I got a plan that could put an 'old on that and keep 'em of our backs. It would mean jumpin' right inta a Longbow base, though. So, ya up for it?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3510176676" "Attack Longbow portal base."
// SendOffString :
"P1964752687" "This is the good bit: You'll go in right through their portal. Once yer in, destroy their phase 'armonic tuners. Should be 3 of 'em. Then, put this Virus inta their computers, and take out their base commander. That should do 'em right."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2226153867" "Attack Longbow portal base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
