// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Signalers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2851783623" "Rikti signal devices"
// DetailString :
"P632660668" "These captured pieces of Rikti technology are made to find ways to signal the aliens. Hook them into the right equipment, and they'll even do it across dimensions."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3275398633" "Those Longbow an' Portal Corps 'eroes just won't let up. We need a way ta distract 'em, or at least find someone else for them ta play with. Fortunately, I got a plan. It's kinda dangerous, and involves tha Rikti. More specifically, it involves <A HREF={ACCEPT}>calling tha Rikti down on Longbow.</A> Ya interested?"
// AcceptString :
"P671659790" "Trick the Rikti to attack Longbow explorers"
// SendOffString :
"P934036359" "There should be 4 devices that tha explorers are usin' ta pin down their coordinates. Plant one a' these devices on each one, an' then get outa there. Tha Rikti should show up any minute an' head ta tha device. Ya might not want ta be there when that happens. Ya should also make sure that the expedition's Leader is out a' tha picture, just ta help tha panic. He's a fella called Dr. Advance. Shouldn't be hard ta miss."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2055946474" "Cause a Rikti attack"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3066671698" "Plant tha devices an' take out tha Expedition's. That should keep 'em in a panic."

