// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_NA_Naylor_Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3657521385" "I don't beleive this, {VillainName}. Arbiter Leery just dropped a major problem on me lap. Seems that Dr. Aeon 'as been doing some interdimensional exploration on 'is own, without any authorization from Arachnos. Now Leery's told me I gotta be tha one ta handle it, or it's tha end a' me project, an' maybe tha end a' me. I ain't got tha forces I'd need ta take Aeon on me own, but Leery did give me some money ta do it with. I could spend a lot of time to get a force together, or I could 'ire you an' anyone else you choose an pay ya tha same ta <A HREF={ACCEPT}>stop Dr. Aeon's unauthorized dimension 'opping.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P4290625475" "Stop Dr. Aeon's unauthorized dimension hopping."
// SendOffString :
"P1126305309" "Thanks, {VillainName}. Ya just saved me weeks a' paperwork. Now, we don't want to gaff Aeon 'imself, 'cause 'e's such a big resource for Arachnos. What I'll need ya ta do is take out 'is expedition force, an then take out 'is lab. For tha expedition, take out the analysis gear an' tha expedition's leader. The world's dead, so there shouldn't be any locals ta interrupt. For tha Lab, you'll have ta go inta Aeon city. Arachnos've already got over-rides ta get ya inside. Once in, you'll destroy tha computers an' capture his two science leads. They'll end up on my team after. I don't think it'll be too hard for ya."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_NA_Naylor_Mission4_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

