// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - HydraSpore 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1412213576" "Hydra Sample"
// DetailString :
"P2706977188" "This is a sample of the spores of the strange slime-creatures called the Hydra. The Rikti seem to use these things as biological weapons. It's no wonder Arachnos is interested in them as well."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1752784786" "I've lost contact with one a' me other exploration teams. They're a bunch a' Arachnos Commandos. I sent 'em to investigate what could be tha world where the Rikti harvest some kinda slime monsters they're usin' over in Paragon, and try ta bring back a sample for experimentation. Last thing I got was that they'd been spotted by tha Rikti. The mission is ta <A HREF={ACCEPT}>go ta that world and try ta bring back any survivors.</A> Are ya up for it?"
// AcceptString :
"P2542191390" "Find survivors from another expedition"
// SendOffString :
"P17327124" "I doubt there'll be more than one or two men alive, but do what ya can. An' try ta find any of their samples. Those slime thingies could be really useful ta know more about."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2233193265" "Rescue expedition"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4280805873" "Everything about this world feels unnatural."

